{
  "name": "Kronos 11 - Watchdog Alert (Webhook)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 11. Watchdog Alert (Webhook)\nRecibe avisos de scripts/watchdog.sh (corre por cron en el host, fuera de Docker) cuando un contenedor del stack se cae o un chequeo de scripts/healthcheck.sh falla. Reenvía el aviso por Telegram usando la credencial que n8n ya tiene — el watchdog en bash no tiene ni necesita el token del bot, evita duplicarlo/exponerlo fuera de n8n. Limitación: si n8n mismo está caído, este canal no funciona — pero en ese caso los mensajes del grupo dejan de procesarse, así que el problema deja de ser silencioso de todas formas.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 750,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0011-4a1a-9a1a-000000001101",
      "name": "Nota: 11. Watchdog Alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1600,
        3800
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "kronos-watchdog-alert",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0011-4a1a-9a1a-000000001102",
      "name": "Webhook watchdog",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -1600,
        3950
      ],
      "webhookId": "f1e2d3c4-b5a6-4978-8899-000000001102",
      "notes": "Autenticación por WATCHDOG_SECRET (query param 'secret') validada en el nodo IF siguiente, no por credencial de n8n — el watchdog en bash no tiene sesión de n8n, solo curl."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 1
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-secret-ok",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.query.secret }}",
              "rightValue": "={{ $env.WATCHDOG_SECRET }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0011-4a1a-9a1a-000000001103",
      "name": "¿Secret válido?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -1350,
        3950
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "sendMessage",
        "chatId": "={{ $env.TELEGRAM_USER_CHAT_ID }}",
        "text": "=🚨 <b>Watchdog Kronos Bot</b>\n\n{{ $json.body.text }}",
        "replyMarkup": "none",
        "additionalFields": {
          "appendAttribution": false,
          "parse_mode": "HTML"
        }
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0011-4a1a-9a1a-000000001104",
      "name": "Avisar en chat: Watchdog",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -1100,
        3900
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "mbd7KXzuERWzRPII",
          "name": "Telegram account"
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "text",
        "responseBody": "={{ $json.query.secret === $env.WATCHDOG_SECRET ? \"ok\" : \"forbidden\" }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": "={{ $json.query.secret === $env.WATCHDOG_SECRET ? 200 : 403 }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0011-4a1a-9a1a-000000001105",
      "name": "Responder al watchdog",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [
        -1100,
        4050
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook watchdog": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "¿Secret válido?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "¿Secret válido?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Avisar en chat: Watchdog",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          },
          {
            "node": "Responder al watchdog",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Responder al watchdog",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "active": true,
  "pinData": null
}
